{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>JPG Converter 是一款輕巧的手機相片轉檔工具，能將照片快速轉換成 JPG、PNG、HEIC 或 PDF 格式，並直接在手機上完成壓縮與分享，方便跨裝置傳送檔案。經常需要整理大量相片、轉換格式或節省儲存空間的用戶尤其適合。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，可於 App Store 下載。</p>\n\n<h2>批次轉檔壓縮一次完成</h2>\n<p>開啟 App 後可一次選取多張相片批次轉換，支援 JPG、PNG、HEIC 與 PDF 等格式，省去逐張處理的時間。內置壓縮調整功能，可在保留畫質下縮減檔案大小，為裝置騰出儲存空間。進階用戶更可切換色彩空間設定，優化相片色彩表現與兼容度，完成後直接分享至其他裝置。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-512-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-513-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-514-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-515-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-516-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-517-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：JPG Converter.</li>\n<li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-22T07:58:00.041051+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}